      "content": "oh wait, i thought you were synced to our internal analytics dashboard for this quarter? my bad. \n\nactually, i just pulled up the raw data on my end. the social engagement is through the roof—orders of magnitude higher than last month. but the sales numbers for the specific promo codes used by the influencers look pretty flat. \n\ngiven how much noise we're making on social, should we consider the campaign a win or is the lack of sales a red flag for the strategy?",
